        ".",
        "p",
        "n",
        "g",
        ")"
      ],
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "id": "b8c9d0e1m",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "To see the full agent code, open [agent/main.py](agent/main.py) in a new tab."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "id": "a3b4c5d6m",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "---\n",
        "\n",
        "## Deploy com Gateway Acoplado\n",
        "\n",
        "Vamos disparar um novo pacote do agente contendo as variáveis ambientais da `MEMORY_ID` e o novo `GATEWAY_ENDPOINT`."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "id": "a3b4c5d6",
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "import sys; sys.path.insert(0, '..')\n",
        "from shared.deploy_agent import deploy\n",
        "from shared.utils import load_config\n",
        "\n",
        "memory_cfg = load_config(\"memory\")\n",
        "\n",
        "env_vars = {}\n",
        "if memory_cfg:\n",
        "    env_vars[\"MEMORY_ID\"] = memory_cfg[\"memory_id\"]\n",
        "env_vars[\"GATEWAY_ENDPOINT\"] = gateway_url\n",
        "\n",
        "result = deploy(\n",
        "    agent_dir=\"agent\",\n",
        "    env_vars=env_vars,\n",
        ")\n",
        "runtime_arn = result[\"runtime_arn\"]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "id": "d6e7f8a9m",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "---\n",
        "\n",
        "## Testando a Gestão de Tarefas (Target API)\n",
        "\n",
        "O Gateway utiliza o `CUSTOM_JWT`. Logo, precisamos injetar o token JWT na rotina de teste `test_agent`."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "id": "e7f8a9b0",
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "import sys; sys.path.insert(0, '..')\n",
        "from shared import test_agent\n",
        "\n",
        "jwt_token = test_agent.get_test_token()\n",
        "\n",
        "# Create a task\n",
        "result = test_agent.invoke(\n",
        "    \"Create a task: Learn about AgentCore Gateway\",\n",
        "    jwt_token=jwt_token,\n",
        ")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "id": "f8a9b0c1m",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "### Listar tarefas"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "id": "a9b0c1d2",
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "# List tasks — same session so Aria has conversation context\n",
        "result = test_agent.invoke(\n",
        "    \"List all my tasks\",\n",
        "    session_id=result[\"session_id\"],\n",
        "    jwt_token=jwt_token,\n",
        ")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "id": "b0c1d2e3m",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "### Atualizar Tarefa para concluída"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "id": "c1d2e3f4",
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "# Complete a task\n",
        "result = test_agent.invoke(\n",
        "    \"Mark the AgentCore Gateway task as completed\",\n",
        "    session_id=result[\"session_id\"],\n",
        "    jwt_token=jwt_token,\n",
        ")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "id": "d2e3f4a5",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "\n",
        "### Conversando Interativamente na CLI\n",
        "\n",
        "Você pode abrir o CLI para conversar. Como agora temos Auth forte na AWS, passe a flag `--auth`:\n",
        "\n",
        "```bash\n",
        "cd /workshop/05-gateway-identity\n",
        "python ../shared/chat.py --auth\n",
        "```\n",
        "\n",
        "Tente criar ou ler as tarefas de forma orgânica e conversacional.\n",
        "\n",
        "> **Documentation:** [Authenticate and authorize with Inbound Auth and Outbound Auth](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/bedrock-agentcore/latest/devguide/identity.html)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "id": "e3f4a5b6",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "---\n",
        "\n",
        "## O que teremos no próximo lab?\n",
        "\n",
        "O Gateway está operante! A falha arquitetural do momento é: **qualquer pessoa logada pode fazer qualquer coisa** -- criar, deletar e bagunçar todas as APIs do endpoint.\n",
        "\n",
        "No **Módulo 6: Política**, aplicaremos as **Políticas Cedar** no Gateway como um escudo impenetrável de regra de negócio."
      ]
    },
